<section class="lv-section lv-faq"><span class="lv-eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2>A few things, answered.</h2><details><summary>Is the free account really free?</summary><p>Yes. Start with one warehouse, inventory management, projects, groups, labels, scanning, and your dashboard. Guest staff accounts and multiple warehouses require Premium.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a barcode scanner?</summary><p>No. Use a supported phone camera over HTTPS, or enter a code manually. A keyboard-style USB or Bluetooth scanner can also enter codes into the barcode field.</p></details><details><summary>Can I organize inventory by room?</summary><p>Yes. Create a project and add room groups beneath it. You can also name custom groups, such as a seasonal collection. Items can stay unassigned until you are ready.</p></details><details><summary>Can my team see every warehouse?</summary><p>Guest staff can access only the warehouses assigned to them within their owner's account. Owners manage their own spaces. Superadmins manage the platform.</p></details><details><summary>Does Luxe Vault include AI features?</summary><p>This foundation focuses on fast, dependable warehouse tools. AI assistance is planned for future releases and is not included in the current feature set.</p></details></section>
